{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>就是她在巴旦亚兰给亚伯兰所生的。</b> 但便雅悯并不是在巴旦亚兰出生的！ Rather, this is what it says: whom she bore to him through the prayer that Rachel prayed <b>in Paddan Aram</b>, when she said, 'May YHWH add me another son,' and from this the verse reckons him as though he were born in Paddan Aram. Another interpretation: since the majority of them were born in Paddan Aram, it is as though all of them were born there — just as we find in the portion of Vayigash: those who came to Egypt were seventy, yet Yosef and his two sons and Yokheved were included in the count, because the verse follows the majority."], :book "genesis", :voice :chizkuni, :lang :zh-Hans, :chapter 35, :timestamp "2026-07-30T20:42:26.247669312Z", :translated-from :en, :model "glm-5.2"}